WEBVTT

00:02:28.063 --> 00:02:31.030
The third one is that we pay
more attention

00:02:31.063 --> 00:02:34.497
to the creativity of people
who live in these places,

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:38.797
we could be aware of innovations
that can save the planet.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.930
Informal settlements
can be broadly described

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:48.330
as self-built neighborhoods
outside of city regulations

00:02:48.363 --> 00:02:50.563
in conditions of extreme poverty.

00:02:51.863 --> 00:02:53.563
Nowadays,

00:02:53.597 --> 00:02:57.230
more than a billion people
live in informal settlements

00:02:57.263 --> 00:02:58.963
all around the world.

00:02:59.663 --> 00:03:01.730
By the year 2050,